                                        "sense_id": "150d86cc-34d4-3ef0-9771-fcd02430864a",
                                        "entry_id": "a8ed6194-6f15-3b07-b532-e6f0b0c9d7ac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An early, very small, lightly armoured tank, with a crew of one or two, equipped with machine guns."
